  "details": "With the recent Open Beta (May 22) and the new Marketplace menu we are now not available to sort our Uploaded avatar lists in any way. Before that you could've sorted them by Date, Last Updated (which is the one i mainly use), Name, Recently Used or even Performance. \n\nSorting is still useful if you have a good amount of avatars and specially useful if you are updating your avatars regularly to add/remove stuff or even looking for optimization.\n\nThose options are still available on the Wings menu but please, don't remove them on this new menu.",
